\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Archive
\f1\b0  \'97 saves a product's tags to a backup, removes them from the product, applies marker tags instead.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Restore
