\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa80\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The product stays published. Only tags change. Effect: it drops out of automated collections and tag filters, reversibly.\
